Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat: add self-contained support-cards + support-video
 blocks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- support-cards: removes the external sapphire-cards dependency (fixes the
  "Error" fallback on this clean branch). Optional image with explicit
  width/height (no CLS) + lazy loading; title, desc, CTA.
- support-video: lazy click-to-load youtube-nocookie embed with reserved
  16:9 space (no CLS, no third-party JS on load).
Both keep prefers-reduced-motion support. Only support-* blocks on this
branch — clean, conflict-free for the colleague's author-kit repo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
